://www.al-monitor.com/originals/2026/08/saudi-expects-imminent-two-pronged-attack-irans-allies-official-says", "title": "Saudi expects imminent two-pronged attack from Iran's allies, official says", "description": "By Timour Azhari RIYADH, Aug 7 (Reuters) - Saudi Arabia expects imminent coordinated attacks from Iraqi militias north of the Gulf state and from Yemen's Houthis from the south under the supervision of Iran's Islamic Revolutionary Guard Corps, a senior Saudi official said. The official, speaking on condition of anonymity, said late on Thursday that intelligence reports from Saudi Arabia, the United States and other regional countries indicated civilian and economic sites could be targeted, including energy infrastructure, ports and airports.", "content": "ONLY AVAILABLE IN PAID PLANS", "keywords": null, "creator": null, "language": "english", "country": ["lebanon", "turkey", "iran", "jordan", "iraq", "egypt", "palestine", "israel", "united arab emirates", "syria", "saudi arabia"], "category": ["world", "politics"], "datatype": "news", "pubDate": "2026-08-07 10:46:32", "pubDateTZ": "UTC", "fetched_at": "2026-08-07 11:05:18", "image_url": "https://www.al-monitor.com/sites/default/files/styles/social_media_share/public/2026-08/2026-08-07T095459Z_1_LYNXMPEM760PZ_RTROPTP_4_IRAN-CRISIS-SAUDI-HOUTHIS.JPG?h=df0980aa&itok=mh8B2NgA", "video_url": null, "source_id": "almonitor", "source_name": "Palestine \u2013 Al-monitor", "source_priority": 21626, "source_url": "https://www.al-monitor.com", "source_icon": "https://n.bytvi.com/almonitor.png", "sentiment": "ONLY AVAILABLE IN PROFESSIONAL AND CORPORATE PLANS", "sentiment_stats": "ONLY AVAILABLE IN PROFESSIONAL AND CORPORATE PLANS", "ai_tag": "ONLY AVAILABLE IN PROFESSIONAL AND CORPORATE PLANS", "ai_region": "ONLY AVAILABLE IN CORPORATE PLANS", "ai_org": "ONLY AVAILABLE IN CORPORATE PLANS", "ai_summary": "ONLY AVAILABLE IN PAID PLANS", "duplicate": true}, {"article_id": "dd681c435f69717cbfd7a4514d564662", "link": "htt